| `story_id`｜正式故事ID | T2-019 |
| `seed_id`｜種子ID | S0819 |
| `quota_date`｜配額歸屬日 | 2027-04-07 |
| `event_type`｜事件類型 | T |
| `music`｜事件配樂 | school |
| `t_topic_id`｜T主題ID | T2-1 |
